# binance-future-hunter — Core

Codebase **matang** (~90 src + ~90 test). Jangan buat "struktur folder awal", Docker, Telegraf bot, atau CI GitHub→VPS.

## Stack nyata

| Layer | Lokasi | Deploy |
|---|---|---|
| Worker MCP + cron | `src/`, `wrangler.toml` | `npx wrangler deploy` (manual) |
| D1 | `migrations/` | `wrangler d1 migrations apply … --remote` |
| KV config | `CONFIG_KV` | jarang write |
| REST relay | `proxy-standalone/` | AWS VPS systemd (+ Caddy); Vercel = legacy |
| WS stream | `stream-gateway/` | AWS VPS systemd + Caddy (bukan Docker) |

Notifikasi = `src/notify.ts` (fan-out Telegram + Discord + generic webhook;
`src/telegram.ts` = impl Telegram). Stage 0–4 sudah **deployed** (2026-09-02).

## Agen + ownership — lihat `agents.mdc` (WAJIB baca)

- **Semeru** (Claude Code) = primary builder + architect. Owns `src/**`,
  `migrations/**`, `docs/**`, `README*`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.cursor/rules/**`,
  gateway/proxy `.mjs` **logika**, `scripts/**`. Plan file + status doc = Semeru only.
- **Rinjani** (Cursor default) = commit hasil kerja Semeru dari tree, owns
  infra-mechanics files (`*.service`, `install.sh`, `oracle-*.sh`,
  `.cursor/*.json`, `wrangler.toml` resource id). Branch `rinjani/<slug>`,
  trailer `Agent: Rinjani`.
- **Krakatau** (Cursor infra) = `--remote`, `wrangler deploy`, `secret put`,
  SSH, AWS SG — **minta acc user dulu**, branch `krakatau/<slug>`, jangan
  gabung diff kode + aksi deploy.

**Cursor nemu bug / mau ubah file Semeru → lapor di chat, Semeru yang edit.**
Satu agen aktif di tree pada satu waktu; handoff eksplisit.

## Larangan umum

- No new npm deps (runtime: `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` + `zod` saja)
- Jangan rename tool `whalescope_*` (backward compat MCP)
- Jangan hardcode secret/token
- Jangan commit/deploy tanpa user minta

Dokumen: `README.md`, `docs/full_pipeline_framework.md`, `CLAUDE.md`
